+# Retrain Guard: Redis & Dynamo Backends
+
+This directory adds Redis- and Dynamo-backed retrain guard implementations to replace the file-backed state.
+
+Files:
+- retrain_guard_redis.py : uses Redis sorted sets + Lua script for atomic cooldown and rate checks.
+- retrain_guard_dynamo.py : alternative DynamoDB implementation (simpler).
+- retrain-guard-deployment.yaml : k8s deployment referencing REDIS_URL.
+
+Operational notes:
+- Set REDIS_URL in deployment env to point to your Redis cluster/service.
+- MULTISIG_VERIFY_CMD should be available in the container image or mounted.
+- For high throughput, use Redis managed service or cluster and ensure network & auth (TLS) are configured.
+- Ensure retrain-guard is called by the orchestrator prior to submitting Argo retrain workflows.
